      "writtenOn": "2023-11-28T08:51:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "there\u0027s a HID call for each WebHID call, even if it is answered in the app or pre-exist, see https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/aosp/packages/modules/Bluetooth/local/system/gd/rust/linux/stack/src/bluetooth_media.rs;drc\u003d62602d69bccad39fd592a6a5c475226a4cf7c6ca;l\u003d1256\n\nWhen we remove the HID device from Meet, meet will not trigger the offhook\u003d0 so the call is not hang up.\n\nWe need to manually hang up call here.",
